Package: gamepi-amdgpu
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gamepi <archie2x@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gamepi-kernel-rpi5 (= @KERNEL_VERSION@), firmware-amd-graphics, libgl1-mesa-dri, mesa-vulkan-drivers, python3
Description: AMD PCIe GPU boot configuration for Gamepi on Raspberry Pi 5
 Activates the tested kernel in a separate firmware boot directory and enables
 the tested AMD and PCIe settings. Stock kernels and boot files are retained.
